<title>MALAYSIA: United Chemical stock suspended - KLSE.</title>
<headline>United Chemical stock suspended - KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of United Chemical Industries Bhd was suspended on Monday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment. Shares of the company, which makes and sells polypropylene and polyethylene woven bags and other products, last traded at 14.40 ringgit, up 90 cents before the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
